// template: Golden Hour
// order: 3
// Soulful house: Rhodes-style chords, a walking bass, live-feel percussion, a lead voice
// answered by a choir.
title "Golden Hour"
tempo 121
key eb major
kick:    kick     warm      x... x... x... x...                                   | drive 0.6 | grit 0.15 | gain 0.85
clap:    clap     tight     .... x... .... x...                                   | reverb small | gain 1.84
snare:   snare    brush     .... x... .... x..x?0.4                               | reverb small | pan 0.1 | gain 0.45
hat:     hat      closed    x x?0.5 x x?0.8 x x?0.5 x x?0.8 x x?0.5 x x?0.8 x x?0.5 x x?0.9   | swing 0.12 | pan -0.2 | gain 0.8
ohat:    hat      dusty     ..x. ..x. ..x. ..x.                                   | gain 0.7 | pan 0.2
shaker:  shaker   soft      x x?0.7 x x?0.7 x x?0.7 x x?0.7 x x?0.7 x x?0.7 x x?0.7 x x?0.7   | swing 0.12 | pan 0.3 | gain 0.75
conga:   conga    high      . . x . . x . x . . x . . x . x?0.5                   | swing 0.12 | pan -0.35 | reverb small | gain 0.55
quinto:  conga    muted     x . . . x . . x . . . x . . x .                       | swing 0.12 | pan 0.4 | gain 0.45
bass:    bass     rolling   ab1 . ab1 . c2 . eb2 . / g1 . g1 . bb1 . d2 . / f1 . f1 . ab1 . c2 . / bb1 . bb1 . d2 . f2 eb2   | duck 0.5 | gain 2
keys:    epiano   soft      . Abmaj9 . . . Abmaj9 . . / . Gm7 . . . Gm7 . . / . Fm9 . . . Fm9 . . / . Bb7sus4 . . . Bb7sus4 . Bb7 .   | voicing open | chorus 0.3 | reverb wide | gain 0.34
organ:   organ    full      Abmaj9 ~ ~ ~ / Gm7 ~ ~ ~ / Fm9 ~ ~ ~ / Bb7sus4 ~ ~ ~ | reverb wide | gain 0.13
strings: strings  tremolo   Ab ~ ~ ~ / Gm ~ ~ ~ / Fm ~ ~ ~ / Bb ~ ~ ~             | reverb sea | gain 0.22
voice:   vox      talk      eb4 ~ ~ . f4 ~ g4 ~ / bb4 ~ ~ ~ g4 ~ . . / ab4 ~ ~ . g4 ~ f4 ~ / g4 ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ . .   | legato | glide 0.06 | delay 1/4 | reverb wide | gain 0.22
choir:   choir    gospel      . . . . Ab ~ ~ ~ / . . . . Gm ~ ~ ~ / . . . . Fm ~ ~ ~ / . . . . Bb ~ ~ ~   | reverb sea | gain 0.19
bell:    bell     glass     g5 . . bb5 . . eb5 . / f5 . . g5 . . d5 . / c5 . . eb5 . . ab5 . / bb5 ~ ~ ~ . . . .   | delay 3/16 | reverb wide | pan 0.3 | gain 0.35
rise:    noise    white     x~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~                                   | cutoff saw(8) 300..9000 | gain saw(8) 0.15..0.5
riser:   riser    both      x... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / ....   | length 15.5 | gain 0.5
down:    downlifter noise   x~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~ / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / ....   | reverb wide | gain 0.6
crash:   crash    short     x... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / ....   | reverb wide | gain 0.45
section intro   kick hat shaker conga keys
section groove  kick clap snare hat ohat shaker conga quinto bass keys | loop
section build   kick clap snare hat shaker conga quinto keys strings rise riser
section drop    kick clap snare hat ohat shaker conga quinto bass keys organ voice choir crash
section break   keys strings voice bell down
section groove2 kick clap snare hat ohat shaker conga quinto bass keys bell
section drop2   kick clap snare hat ohat shaker conga quinto bass keys organ strings voice choir crash
section outro   kick hat shaker conga keys
song intro 16, groove 32, build 8, drop 32, break 16, build 8, drop2 32, groove2 16, outro 16
